# Smoke test for the live deployment. Replace the URL with your Render service URL.
# The first request may take up to a minute while the free instance wakes up.
@baseUrl = https://medcore-api.onrender.com/api
@password = MedCoreDev2026!

### 1. Liveness: the process is up
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Readiness: database and Redis reachable, time zone should be Africa/Lagos
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### 3. Login works against the hosted database and Redis
# @name admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@medcore.test", "password": "{{password}}" }

### 4. Dashboard returns real seeded numbers in NGN
GET {{baseUrl}}/hospitals/{{admin.response.body.user.hospitalId}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5. Refresh token round trip (proves Redis is storing sessions)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{admin.response.body.refreshToken}}" }








